# MedDesk Frontend Environment Configuration

# Backend API Base URL
# In local development: Leave blank to use the Vite proxy (/api -> http://127.0.0.1:8000)
# In production on Netlify: Set this to your deployed Render FastAPI URL (no trailing slash)
# Example: VITE_API_URL=https://hospital-support-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=
